  "description": "Private LLM: Palisade allows you to run powerful AI assistants entirely on your iPhone/iPad—no account, no cloud, no tracking. Palisade keeps your conversations on your device, even in airplane mode.\n\nWhy Palisade\n\n100% on-device: Works fully offline; nothing is sent to external servers.\n\nPrivate by design: No sign-in, no ads, no background data collection.\n\nFast & handy: Ask questions, write and summarize text, translate, and brainstorm.\n\nModel flexibility: Use efficient on-device models (Gemma, Llama, etc.)\n\nGreat for\n\nSensitive notes and work that must stay offline\n\nStudy and travel—reliable even without internet\n\nDevelopers who want a local AI companion\n\nWhat to expect\nRunning AI models on-device means speed and quality depend on your device and the model size you choose. \n\nPrivacy promise\nYour data stays on your device. Delete conversations anytime.\n\nDisclaimer: Generations from AI model can contain inaccuracies. Always verify important information independently.",
